/T (A reading is valid when it lies in [-50, 50] degrees C \(anything else is a sensor error\). Fahrenheit is C*9/5+32. An alarm minute is the position \(found with enumerate\) of a valid reading outside 2-8 C; sensor errors are excluded because they carry no temperature information.)
/E (A reading is valid when it lies in [-50, 50] degrees C \(anything else is a sensor error\). Fahrenheit is C*9/5+32. An alarm minute is the position \(found with enumerate\) of a valid reading outside 2-8 C; sensor errors are excluded because they carry no temperature information.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [29]
>>
endobj
