971 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 128 0 R
/T (Without an index one query must examine every stop of every train: if there are T trains with an average of s stops, that is T x s comparisons - O\(total stops\) - even though only a few trains call at the station. With the index \(station -> [\(train, arrival, departure\), ...]\) the query is one dictionary look-up \(O\(1\) average\) followed by one day check for each train that actually stops there: O\(k\), k = trains at the station. The index is built once in O\(total stops\).)
/E (Without an index one query must examine every stop of every train: if there are T trains with an average of s stops, that is T x s comparisons - O\(total stops\) - even though only a few trains call at the station. With the index \(station -> [\(train, arrival, departure\), ...]\) the query is one dictionary look-up \(O\(1\) average\) followed by one day check for each train that actually stops there: O\(k\), k = trains at the station. The index is built once in O\(total stops\).)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
