/E (Data structures. a dict from key to the first contact that used it \(O\(1\) look-up\), sets for names, numbers and e-mails \(automatic de-duplication\), a union-find array \(list of parent indexes\) to join contacts that share a key, and a dict from group representative to merged record.)
