/T (Measurable requirements. R1: all formats of the same number normalise to the same 10-digit string. R2: no number or e-mail present in the input is missing from the output \(union of inputs = union of outputs\). R3: contacts with the same name but different numbers remain separate records. R4: each distinct normalised number appears in exactly one output record. R5: 100,000 contacts are merged in under 5 seconds on the development machine \(measured below: 0.93 s\). R6: the result equals that of the exhaustive pairwise comparison.)
