/P 133 0 R
/T (The dictionary-and-union-find design meets all six requirements: formats are normalised, nothing is lost, same-name strangers stay apart, and it scales to 100,000 contacts in about a second. Pairwise comparison is simpler to write but its quadratic cost makes it impractical beyond a few thousand contacts; it remains a useful independent check of the faster algorithm on small inputs, which is how it was used here.)
/E (The dictionary-and-union-find design meets all six requirements: formats are normalised, nothing is lost, same-name strangers stay apart, and it scales to 100,000 contacts in about a second. Pairwise comparison is simpler to write but its quadratic cost makes it impractical beyond a few thousand contacts; it remains a useful independent check of the faster algorithm on small inputs, which is how it was used here.)
