/Title (How the evidence was produced. Every program in this report was executed; the output blocks are the unedited output saved by the program \(output.txt\) and every table and graph is drawn from the numbers that the programs recorded \(results.json\). Timings are the best of three runs on one computer, so absolute values will differ on another machine, but the trends and operation counts will not. Random data uses fixed seeds, so the experiments are repeatable. Where a measurement was too expensive to run \(for example, comparing every pair of 100,000 contacts\) this report says so and gives an extrapolation that is clearly labelled as such.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1445 0 R
>>
endobj
