/Title (What the three slices return. readings[7:14] returns the 7 items at indexes 7-13, i.e. days 8 to 14, the second week \(stop index is excluded\). readings[-7:] returns the last 7 items, days 359-365 \(a negative start counts from the end\). readings[::7] returns every 7th item starting at index 0, i.e. days 1, 8, 15, ..., 365 - 53 items for a 365-day list. Each slice is a new list.)
